1791759076536815	claude-jarldom	itc:AQ		item.comment	bn-2zq	{"body":"Relog verified 2026-10-11: colony, roster, miners' trips under way (rose on time after), claims (global keys), doors, petitions all carried over; no errors after load. Still open: 30-40 villager perf pass after today's changes."}	blake3:P3ap7q5bT3H1YnHyDGGZl1_SYwVz1ARFczbqDPwk3u4
